/E (slow and subjective. Management wants to know whether laboratory \(physicochemical\) measurements can help explain differences in quality and support a data-driven screening process. The objectives are to \(i\) describe the main variables statistically, \(ii\) find which measurements are most strongly associated with quality, \(iii\) build and evaluate a multiple linear regression model that predicts the quality score, and \(iv\) advise whether the model can be used in practice.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
78 0 obj
