/E (Dataset. Red Vinho Verde wine from Portugal \(Cortez et al., 2009\): 1599 samples, 11 physicochemical inputs \(fixed acidity, volatile acidity, citric acid, residual sugar, chlorides, free sulfur dioxide, total sulfur dioxide, density, pH, sulphates, alcohol\) and one output, quality, which is the median of at least three expert scores. There are no missing values. Only the red wine file is analysed in this report.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [16]
>>
